# What Heal becomes while Righteously Indignant is on: the Cleric's emergency
# heal traded for a six-enemy swing. It sits in Heal's row of the Cleric's book
# and has whatever level Heal has, so it costs nothing of its own (see
# Skill.replaces_skill_name).
#
# GMS climbs 250+5x over twenty levels; here ten levels end exactly where GMS
# does. Its DEF reduction on what it hits is dropped: nothing here keeps a
# condition on a monster.
name: "Angelic Wrath"
description:
  "Calls down an avenging angel to strike the enemy. Enemies struck will be "
  "weakened."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_VENGEANCE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 10
replaces_skill_name: "Heal"
toggle_skill_name: "Righteously Indignant"
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 6
lines: 5
base { skill_pct: 2.60 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
